.Trashes
# AppleDouble sidecars, created when the project lives on a non-HFS volume
._*

# Never allow a vault — real or synthetic — into the repository.
# The clinical folder is user-configurable, so matching only the default name
# would miss a renamed one. .obsidian and .base are the reliable markers of a
# vault, and every managed record lives beside one of them.
Clinical Workspace/
Clinical*/
**/.obsidian/
**/*.base
vault/
vaults/
# Record filenames are generated with these prefixes, wherever they end up.
**/PAT-*.md
**/EPI-*.md
**/TSK-*.md
**/PRC-*.md
**/EVT-*.md

# Defence in depth for the repository-side logbook exporter. Custom output
# names still require operator review; do not broadly ignore every CSV.
**/surgery-logbook.csv
**/surgery-logbook-*.csv
**/.surgery-logbook*.tmp
**/.clinical-workspace-export-*.tmp
